    "title": "LsMsgPack MCP server",
    "version": "2026.10.10.1",
    "description": "MsgPack for AI agents: an MCP server (stdio) and command line tool that decode MsgPack data (LsMsgPack's indexed schema, type ids, extensions) into text an AI can read, and that read the bytes of variables of a program paused in the debugger of VS Code or Visual Studio (through the MsgPack Explorer extensions)."
  },
